  "description": "Typed C# client + DTOs for the tamp-ingest-v1 egress contract — the canonical wire shape any Tamp.Security.Pipeline-driven build pushes to a compliant dashboard / defect tracker / evidence vault. First server-side consumer: tamp.findings. Wraps the seven ingest endpoints (SBOM / provenance / findings / coverage / test results / scan runs / vulnerabilities) as Async methods on TampIngestClient (derived from Tamp.Http.TampApiClient). Hierarchy tuple (Client → Project → Component → ComponentVersion + Flavor / Branch / PullRequestRef) modelled as the IngestBuildContext record.",
